{%- comment -%}
  Contacto ELYXIE — la página de contacto (page.contact). Porta dos fuentes Dawn:
  `main-page.liquid` (page.title + page.content sobre el formulario) y
  `contact-form.liquid` (el {% form 'contact' %} con nombre/correo/teléfono/mensaje
  + estados de éxito/error). Re-piel completa al idioma ELYXIE; NO se re-arquitectura
  el formulario.

  Vive bajo el layout `elyxie-page` (wordmark champán + ES/EN + carrito + footer de
  marca + vacío esmeralda). Composición editorial a dos columnas: a la izquierda la
  invocación (eyebrow + título serif italic + prosa + otras vías de contacto); a la
  derecha el formulario. En móvil colapsa a una sola columna (prosa primero, formulario
  después). Bilingüe ES/EN — el español lidera.

  CONSERVADO 1:1 de Dawn (no tocar el comportamiento Shopify):
  - {%- form 'contact', id: 'ContactForm' -%} … {%- endform -%}
  - name="contact[{{ 'templates.contact.form.name' | t }}]" (clave = etiqueta localizada
    "Nombre"/"Name"), name="contact[email]" (literal), teléfono y comentario igual.
  - form.posted_successfully? → confirmación reverente; form.errors → resumen de error.
  - El correo es el único campo validado por Shopify: aria-required, aria-invalid,
    aria-describedby y el small de error en línea se mantienen tal cual.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_en = false -%}
{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}{%- assign is_en = true -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%} Título: override del editor → título de la página → frase de marca. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heading = section.settings.heading | strip -%}
{%- if heading == blank -%}
  {%- if page.title != blank -%}
    {%- assign heading = page.title -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- if is_en -%}{%- assign heading = 'Write to us' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign heading = 'Escríbenos' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign eyebrow = section.settings.eyebrow | strip -%}
{%- if eyebrow == blank -%}{%- if is_en -%}{%- assign eyebrow = 'Contact' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign eyebrow = 'Contacto' -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}

<style>
  .econt {
    --en-hair: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    --en-hair-champ: rgba(233,215,177,0.22);
    --en-bronze: #D97757;                       /* error de marca — bronce desaturado, nunca rojo */
    --en-field-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    --en-field-bg-focus: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    --en-field-line: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(40px,7vw,104px) clamp(20px,5vw,64px) clamp(88px,13vw,168px);
  }

  /* ── Rejilla editorial: invocación (izq) + formulario (der) ──────────────── */
  /* 0.92fr / 1.08fr — el formulario pesa un punto más que la prosa para que el ojo
     aterrice en el campo, sin que la columna izquierda se sienta accesoria. */
  .econt__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.92fr 1.08fr;
    gap: clamp(40px,6vw,96px); align-items: start; }

  /* ── Columna izquierda: la invocación ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .econt__intro { max-width: 46ch; }
  .econt__eyebrow { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .econt__title { margin: clamp(14px,1.6vw,20px) 0 0; font-family: var(--ep-serif); font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(42px,6.4vw,84px); line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ep-ink); text-wrap: balance; }
  .econt__lede { margin: clamp(18px,2vw,26px) 0 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.74); }

  /* prosa del editor (page.content), si la hay — texto corrido a 4.5:1+ sobre el vacío */
  .econt__rte { margin: clamp(22px,2.4vw,32px) 0 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); }
  .econt__rte > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .econt__rte > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .econt__rte p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .econt__rte a { color: var(--ep-champ); text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--en-hair-champ); transition: border-color 240ms ease; }
  .econt__rte a:hover { border-color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .econt__rte h2, .econt__rte h3 { font-family: var(--ep-serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ep-ink); line-height: 1.15; margin: 28px 0 12px; }
  .econt__rte h2 { font-size: clamp(26px,3vw,34px); }
  .econt__rte h3 { font-size: 22px; }

  /* otras vías — bloque tenue de detalles directos (opcional, por settings) */
  .econt__ways { margin: clamp(32px,4vw,52px) 0 0; padding-top: clamp(24px,3vw,34px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--en-hair); display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .econt__way { display: grid; gap: 5px; }
  .econt__way-label { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
  .econt__way-value { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-serif); font-size: clamp(20px,2vw,24px);
    line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ep-ink); }
  .econt__way-value a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; transition: border-color 240ms ease, color 240ms ease; }
  .econt__way-value a:hover { color: var(--ep-champ); border-bottom-color: var(--en-hair-champ); }

  /* croquis — Google Maps embebido bajo la dirección. El filtro invert+hue-rotate
     vuelve el mapa claro de Google un plano oscuro que no rompe el vacío esmeralda;
     el pin sigue siendo visible (vira a cian). El enlace externo es la vía fiable
     a Google Maps (el iframe queda como vista). */
  .econt__map { margin: 14px 0 0; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--en-hair); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .econt__map iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;
    filter: invert(0.89) hue-rotate(180deg) saturate(0.5) contrast(0.9); }
  .econt__map-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-top: 12px;
    font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.26em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ep-champ); text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--en-hair-champ); padding-bottom: 3px;
    transition: border-color 240ms ease; }
  .econt__map-link:hover { border-color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .econt__map-link svg { transition: transform 240ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1); }
  .econt__map-link:hover svg { transform: translateX(4px); }

  /* ── Columna derecha: la superficie del formulario ───────────────────────── */
  /* Superficie con redondeo (18px) y glow contenido — el único bloque que "sube"
     un escalón desde el vacío; los campos dentro son nítidos (esquina viva). */
  .econt__panel { position: relative; border-radius: 18px; padding: clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,60,50,0.30), rgba(11,36,29,0.30));
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(5,22,19,0.45), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }

  .econt__form { display: grid; gap: clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px); }
  /* nombre + correo en par a partir de 560px de panel; teléfono y mensaje a ancho completo */
  .econt__row { display: grid; gap: clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px); }
  @container econt-panel (min-width: 560px) {
    .econt__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  /* Campo: floating label CSS puro. La etiqueta reposa sobre el campo y sube al
     enfocar o con valor (:not(:placeholder-shown)). Placeholder transparente: el
     placeholder real existe (Dawn lo necesita) pero no se ve, solo dispara el estado. */
  .econt__field { position: relative; }
  .econt__field .field__input {
    width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0; appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    background: var(--en-field-bg); border: 1px solid var(--en-field-line); border-radius: 0;
    color: var(--ep-ink); font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 26px 18px 10px; min-height: 58px;
    transition: border-color 240ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1), background 240ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1); }
  .econt__field textarea.field__input { min-height: 168px; resize: vertical; line-height: 1.6;
    padding-top: 28px; }
  .econt__field .field__input::placeholder { color: transparent; }
  .econt__field .field__input:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
  .econt__field .field__input:focus { outline: none;
    border-color: var(--ep-champ); background: var(--en-field-bg-focus); }
  .econt__field .field__input:focus-visible { outline: none; }
  /* autofill: navegadores pintan un fondo claro; lo neutralizamos hacia el vacío */
  .econt__field .field__input:-webkit-autofill,
  .econt__field .field__input:-webkit-autofill:focus {
    -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--ep-ink);
    -webkit-box-shadow: 0 0 0 1000px #0C2C24 inset;
    caret-color: var(--ep-ink); }

  .econt__field .field__label { position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px; margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    pointer-events: none; transform-origin: left top;
    transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1), color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1); }
  .econt__field .field__input:focus + .field__label,
  .econt__field .field__input:not(:placeholder-shown) + .field__label {
    transform: translateY(-10px) scale(0.72); letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .econt__field .field__input:focus + .field__label { color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .econt__field .field__input:not(:placeholder-shown):not(:focus) + .field__label {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
  /* el asterisco del correo no se pone en mayúsculas con el resto de la etiqueta */
  .econt__field .field__label span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--en-bronze); }

  /* estado inválido (solo correo, lo único que Shopify valida en este form) */
  .econt__field--error .field__input { border-color: var(--en-bronze); }
  .econt__field-error { display: block; margin: 8px 0 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans);
    font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--en-bronze); }
  .econt__field-error .svg-wrapper { display: none; }   /* el icono Dawn no encaja; el color basta */
  .econt__field-error .form__message { display: inline; }

  /* ── CTA precioso: oro nítido (esquina viva), glow que crece en hover ────── */
  .econt__submit { justify-self: start; margin-top: clamp(6px,1vw,12px); }
  .econt__submit .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; cursor: pointer; border: 0; border-radius: 0;
    padding: 18px 44px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #E9D7B1, #C9A66B); color: #0A2620;
    font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(233,215,177,0.25);
    transition: box-shadow 360ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1), transform 360ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1); }
  .econt__submit .button svg { transition: transform 240ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1); }
  .econt__submit .button:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 46px rgba(233,215,177,0.42); }
  .econt__submit .button:hover svg { transform: translateX(5px); }
  .econt__submit .button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ep-champ); outline-offset: 4px; }

  /* ── Éxito: bloque fósforo (la luz guardada devuelta) ────────────────────── */
  .econt__success { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; margin: 0 0 clamp(24px,3vw,34px);
    padding: 22px 24px; border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(125,255,178,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(125,255,178,0.32); }
  .econt__success svg { flex: none; margin-top: 3px; color: #7DFFB2; }
  .econt__success-text { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(246,242,232,0.92); }
  .econt__success-text strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-family: var(--ep-serif);
    font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; color: #fff; }

  /* ── Resumen de error (encabezado + lista) ───────────────────────────────── */
  .econt__error-summary { margin: 0 0 clamp(24px,3vw,34px); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(217,119,87,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(217,119,87,0.32); }
  .econt__error-summary h2 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--en-bronze); }
  .econt__error-summary h2 .svg-wrapper { display: none; }
  .econt__error-list { margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .econt__error-list li { font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .econt__error-list a { color: rgba(246,242,232,0.9); text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--en-bronze); transition: color 240ms ease; }
  .econt__error-list a:hover { color: #fff; }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    /* una sola columna: la invocación arriba, el formulario debajo */
    .econt__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: clamp(40px,8vw,56px); }
    .econt__intro { max-width: none; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .econt__field .field__input, .econt__field .field__label,
    .econt__submit .button, .econt__submit .button svg, .econt__rte a, .econt__way-value a,
    .econt__map-link, .econt__map-link svg {
      transition: none; }
  }
</style>

<section class="econt">
  <div class="econt__grid">
    {%- comment -%} ── Columna izquierda: la invocación + prosa del editor ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="econt__intro">
      <p class="econt__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
      <h1 class="econt__title">{{ heading }}</h1>

      {%- if section.settings.lede != blank -%}
        <p class="econt__lede">{{ section.settings.lede }}</p>
      {%- else -%}
        <p class="econt__lede">
          {%- if is_en -%}
            Tell us what you are looking for. Every message reaches a person, not a queue, and we answer with care.
          {%- else -%}
            Cuéntanos qué buscas. Cada mensaje llega a una persona, no a una cola, y respondemos con cuidado.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.show_page_content and page.content != blank -%}
        <div class="econt__rte rte">{{ page.content }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Otras vías de contacto — opcionales, vacío = oculto. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if section.settings.contact_email != blank or section.settings.contact_phone != blank or section.settings.contact_whatsapp != blank or section.settings.contact_location != blank -%}
        <div class="econt__ways">
          {%- if section.settings.contact_email != blank -%}
            <div class="econt__way">
              <p class="econt__way-label">{% if is_en %}By correspondence{% else %}Por correo{% endif %}</p>
              <p class="econt__way-value"><a href="mailto:{{ section.settings.contact_email }}">{{ section.settings.contact_email }}</a></p>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.contact_whatsapp != blank -%}
            <div class="econt__way">
              <p class="econt__way-label">{% if is_en %}Support · WhatsApp{% else %}Soporte · WhatsApp{% endif %}</p>
              {%- assign wa_href = section.settings.contact_whatsapp | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '-' -%}
              <p class="econt__way-value"><a href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ section.settings.contact_whatsapp }}</a></p>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.contact_phone != blank -%}
            <div class="econt__way">
              <p class="econt__way-label">{% if is_en %}By voice{% else %}Por voz{% endif %}</p>
              {%- assign tel_href = section.settings.contact_phone | remove: ' ' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '-' -%}
              <p class="econt__way-value"><a href="tel:{{ tel_href }}">{{ section.settings.contact_phone }}</a></p>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.contact_location != blank -%}
            <div class="econt__way">
              <p class="econt__way-label">{% if is_en %}The address{% else %}La dirección{% endif %}</p>
              <p class="econt__way-value">{{ section.settings.contact_location }}</p>
              {%- if section.settings.show_map -%}
                {%- assign map_q = section.settings.contact_location | url_encode -%}
                <div class="econt__map">
                  <iframe
                    src="https://www.google.com/maps?q={{ map_q }}&hl={% if is_en %}en{% else %}es{% endif %}&z=16&output=embed"
                    loading="lazy"
                    referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
                    title="{% if is_en %}Map — {{ section.settings.contact_location | escape }}{% else %}Croquis — {{ section.settings.contact_location | escape }}{% endif %}"
                  ></iframe>
                </div>
                <a class="econt__map-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query={{ map_q }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                  {% if is_en %}Open in Google Maps{% else %}Abrir en Google Maps{% endif %}
                  <svg width="13" height="9" viewBox="0 0 13 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M1 4.5h10M7.5 1L11 4.5 7.5 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ── Columna derecha: el formulario (machinery Dawn, piel ELYXIE) ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="econt__panel" style="container: econt-panel / inline-size;">
      {%- form 'contact', id: 'ContactForm', class: 'econt__form' -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          {%- comment -%} Confirmación reverente — bloque fósforo, autofocus para lectores de pantalla. {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="econt__success" tabindex="-1" autofocus role="status">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.5"/>
              <path d="M6.5 11.2l3 3 6-6.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            <p class="econt__success-text">
              <strong>{% if is_en %}Your message is received.{% else %}Tu mensaje quedó recibido.{% endif %}</strong>
              {%- if is_en -%}
                We will write back soon. Thank you for reaching the water.
              {%- else -%}
                Te escribiremos pronto. Gracias por acercarte al agua.
              {%- endif -%}
            </p>
          </div>
        {%- elsif form.errors -%}
          {%- comment -%} Resumen de error — bronce desaturado; el enlace lleva al campo del correo. {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="econt__error-summary">
            <h2 class="form-status" role="alert" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
              <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
              {% if is_en %}Please adjust the following{% else %}Por favor, ajusta lo siguiente{% endif %}
            </h2>
            <ul class="econt__error-list" role="list">
              <li>
                <a href="#ContactForm-email" class="link">
                  {{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }}
                  {{ form.errors.messages.email }}
                </a>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="econt__row">
          {%- comment -%} Nombre — clave del campo = etiqueta localizada (idéntico a Dawn). {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="econt__field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              autocomplete="name"
              type="text"
              id="ContactForm-name"
              name="contact[{{ 'templates.contact.form.name' | t }}]"
              value="{% if form.name %}{{ form.name }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.name }}{% endif %}"
              placeholder="{{ 'templates.contact.form.name' | t }}"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="ContactForm-name">{% if is_en %}Name{% else %}Nombre{% endif %}</label>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} Correo — único campo validado por Shopify; se conserva todo el cableado aria. {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="econt__field{% if form.errors contains 'email' %} econt__field--error{% endif %}">
            <input
              autocomplete="email"
              type="email"
              id="ContactForm-email"
              class="field__input"
              name="contact[email]"
              spellcheck="false"
              autocapitalize="off"
              value="{% if form.email %}{{ form.email }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.email }}{% endif %}"
              aria-required="true"
              {% if form.errors contains 'email' %}
                aria-invalid="true"
                aria-describedby="ContactForm-email-error"
              {% endif %}
              placeholder="{{ 'templates.contact.form.email' | t }}"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="ContactForm-email">
              {%- if is_en %}Email{% else %}Correo{% endif %}
              <span aria-hidden="true">*</span>
            </label>
            {%- if form.errors contains 'email' -%}
              <small class="econt__field-error" id="ContactForm-email-error">
                <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'accessibility.error' | t }}</span>
                <span class="form__message">
                  <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
                  {{- form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }}
                  {{ form.errors.messages.email -}}
                </span>
              </small>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} Teléfono — clave del campo = etiqueta localizada (idéntico a Dawn). {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="econt__field">
          <input
            type="tel"
            id="ContactForm-phone"
            class="field__input"
            autocomplete="tel"
            name="contact[{{ 'templates.contact.form.phone' | t }}]"
            pattern="[0-9\-]*"
            value="{% if form.phone %}{{ form.phone }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.phone }}{% endif %}"
            placeholder="{{ 'templates.contact.form.phone' | t }}"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="ContactForm-phone">{% if is_en %}Phone{% else %}Teléfono{% endif %}</label>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} Mensaje — clave del campo = etiqueta localizada (idéntico a Dawn).
          Sin espacios entre la etiqueta de apertura del textarea y {{ form.body }}: cualquier
          blanco se renderiza dentro y rompería el estado :placeholder-shown del floating label. {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="econt__field">
          <textarea
            rows="10"
            id="ContactForm-body"
            class="text-area field__input"
            name="contact[{{ 'templates.contact.form.comment' | t }}]"
            placeholder="{{ 'templates.contact.form.comment' | t }}"
          >{{- form.body -}}</textarea>
          <label class="field__label" for="ContactForm-body">{% if is_en %}Message{% else %}Mensaje{% endif %}</label>
        </div>

        <div class="econt__submit">
          <button type="submit" class="button">
            {% if is_en %}Send{% else %}Enviar{% endif %}
            <svg width="13" height="9" viewBox="0 0 13 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M1 4.5h10M7.5 1L11 4.5 7.5 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Contacto ELYXIE",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "info": "Vacío = 'Contacto' / 'Contact'" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Título", "info": "Vacío = título de la página (page.title)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "lede", "label": "Frase de entrada", "info": "Vacío = frase de marca bilingüe por defecto" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_page_content", "label": "Mostrar contenido de la página (page.content)", "default": true },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Otras vías de contacto", "info": "Opcionales. Vacío = oculto." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "contact_email", "label": "Correo de contacto", "info": "Ej. hola@elyxie.com" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "contact_whatsapp", "label": "WhatsApp (soporte)", "info": "Ej. +51 976 616 514 — enlaza a wa.me" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "contact_phone", "label": "Teléfono", "info": "Ej. +51 999 999 999" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "contact_location", "label": "Dirección", "info": "Ej. Avenida Don Diego de Día 228, Santiago de Surco" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_map", "label": "Mostrar croquis (Google Maps) bajo la dirección", "default": true }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Contacto ELYXIE" }]
}
{% endschema %}
